[engl]
{100}{}{Gizmo}
{200}{}{You see Gizmo, the casino owner.}
{210}{}{This is easily the most corpulent individual you have ever seen.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> Gizmo21]}
{2000}{}{Hey, what the hell do you think you're doing? Izo, tear his arms off!
---
Hey, what the hell do you think you're doing? Izo, tear off her arms!}
{2010}{}{[Done.]}
{3000}{}{What do you want? I'm a busy man.}
{3010}{}{Blehh.}
{3020}{}{I took care of Killian. Word is you might appreciate that.}
{3030}{}{I'm here to tell you your assassin failed.}
{3040}{}{I'm here to talk about the attempt on Killian's life.}
{3050}{}{Nothing, actually. I'll just be going now.}
{3060}{}{I want to know how someone as stupid as you is still alive.}
{4000}{}{Get outta here, ya' idiot!}
{4010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmox2]}
{5000}{}{Oh, yeah. Oh, yeah! Izo's got your money. Oh, this is good! Hey, hey, uh . . . you
should leave town for a while. You know, just in case.}
{5010}{}{Okay, I'm going.}
{5020}{}{Sure, I'll go. Just remember you owe me one.}
{5030}{}{You don't order me around, fat boy. You got that?}
{5040}{}{And if I don't?}
{6000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Gizmo15_1']}
{6010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo11]}
{6020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo16]}
{7000}{}{One is okay. Two is too much. And that was two. Izo, get me a set of kneecaps.}
{7010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmox1]}
{8000}{}{You don't leave town, you end up under it. You got me?}
{8010}{}{Okay, okay. I'm going.}
{8020}{}{All right, fine. Just remember you owe me.}
{8030}{}{Who's going to do that? You? You couldn't get off your fat butt to get a sandwich, much
less kill me.}
{9000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Gizmo16a']}
{9010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> DownReactLevel]}
{9020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> badmouth]}
{10000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'DownReactLevel']}
{10010}{}{[Done.]}
{11000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'badmouth']}
{11010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo11]}
{11020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo10]}
{12000}{}{Sorry you feel that way. Not as sorry as you're gonna be, though. Can't let word of this
get out. Izo, show our new friend what we do with people who say no to me.}
{12010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmox1]}
{13000}{}{I don't know what you're talking about.}
{13010}{}{You're right. Goodbye.}
{13020}{}{You don't remember hiring someone to kill Killian, you stupid slug?}
{13030}{}{You're a liar!}
{13040}{}{Of course you do. You hired someone to kill Killian, and he screwed up.}
{13050}{}{Oh, really?}
{13060}{}{Well, let's take a hypothetical situation . . .}
{14000}{}{I don't like people who waste my time. Don't come back again soon!}
{14010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmox2]}
{15000}{}{You know, [Gizmo sighs] I don't like it when people insult me in my own place. Izo,
escort our guest out . . . through the window.}
{15010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmox1]}
{16000}{}{I don't know who you are, but I don't take kindly to strangers walking into my office
and accusing me of things they know nothing about.}
{16010}{}{You're right. I'm leaving.}
{16020}{}{I know it all. So confess!}
{16030}{}{Ah, but there's where you miss the point, Gizmo. I'm not accusing. I'm here to help you.}
{16040}{}{Hey, okay, if you don't want him dead, fine. Just tryin' to be helpful.}
{17000}{}{Really? [Gizmo chuckles.] He's gonna help me? What kinda help are we talking about?
---
Really? [Gizmo chuckles.] She's gonna help me? What kinda help are we talking about?}
{17010}{}{Nothing. Forget I brought it up.}
{17020}{}{Easy. You sent someone to kill Killian. He failed. You need someone who can do the job .
. . better.}
{17030}{}{I was thinking maybe knife in the back or bullet in the head.}
{18000}{}{And let me guess. You're that someone?}
{18010}{}{Very good . . . For a price, of course.}
{18020}{}{I can kill him quicker than you can spit.}
{19000}{}{Well, how can I trust you?}
{19010}{}{I'm here. And you need someone from out of town to do your dirty work. Right?}
{19020}{}{Because I've been around. I've killed before.}
{19030}{}{You can't . . . I mean you can . . . I mean . . .}
{20000}{}{Hmm . . . all right. We can do this. But you work for me, you better know that nobody
ever double-crosses Gizmo and lives to talk about it. You got me?}
{20010}{}{Oh, I could put one over on you . . . just no way anyone could put one 'round you.}
{20020}{}{Of course. But first I need to know why you want him dead.}
{20030}{}{Got it. What'cha want 'im dead for?}
{21000}{}{Huh. That's easy. I want him dead because he cramps my business. So, will you do him for
me?}
{21010}{}{Could you say that again please . . . this time in my coat pocket?}
{21020}{}{Well, um . . . No, I can't.}
{21030}{}{That's why I'm here. He'll be dead before sundown.}
{21040}{}{Sure. It's a job.}
{22000}{}{You're either real stupid . . . or a real stupid spy. Doesn't matter, because now Izo's
gonna make you real dead.}
{22010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmox1]}
{23000}{}{Good. Return with the dog tags he wears around his neck as proof. And we never had this
conversation, you don't mention this to anyone. No one double crosses me. No one.}
{23010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmox]}
{24000}{}{Such as?}
{24010}{}{Huh? Oh, never mind.}
{24020}{}{Well, let's say you did try and kill Killian, and your assassin failed. That means you
need a new one to do the job right.}
{25000}{}{Did ya' finish the job yet?}
{25010}{}{Yep, sure did.}
{25020}{}{Nope, not yet.}
{26000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Gizmo13_1']}
{26010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo14]}
{26020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo17]}
{27000}{}{Let's see the tags.}
{27010}{}{[Done.]}
{28000}{}{Then give me the dog tags?}
{28010}{}{I lied. I don't have them.}
{28020}{}{I had them, but then I lost them.}
{28030}{}{Um . . . well . . . I . . . uh, lost them.}
{28040}{}{What if I don't want to give them you?}
{29000}{}{No tags, no money. You come back without the tags again and Izo gets creative with your
anatomy. Now get out!}
{29010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo11]}
{29020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmox]}
{30000}{}{[Gizmo laughs.] You know, you're a crummy liar. Now go get the tags. I don't want to see
your face until you've offed Killian.}
{30010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo11]}
{30020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmox]}
{31000}{}{No problem, I take them off your dead body.}
{31010}{}{Uh . . . well, I kinda lied. I don't have them.}
{31020}{}{Well, I had them, but they were stolen.}
{31030}{}{I lost them.}
{31040}{}{Yeah? You going to hire somebody to do your bending for you?}
{32000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Gizmo19a']}
{32010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo11]}
{32020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> DownReactLevel]}
{33000}{}{You're back. You know, I had to hire someone else to do your work. That didn't make me
happy. In fact, Izo will show you just how unhappy I am. I hope you had a nice day. It
was your last.}
{33010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmox1]}
{34000}{}{Get your butt in here and sit down. We got some business to discuss.}
{34010}{}{Looks like there's enough butt in here already . . .}
{34020}{}{I gathered as much. What do you want?}
{34030}{}{What business?}
{34040}{}{Blehh.}
{35000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Gizmo01_1']}
{35010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo02]}
{36000}{}{You kiss your mother with that mouth? Show some respect.}
{36010}{}{You're right, I'm sorry. So let's talk business.}
{36020}{}{You do anything but eat?}
{37000}{}{All right, [Gizmo snorts] here's the deal. Junktown, it ain't what it used to be. The
only reason it's still here is because of my gambling establishment. Even so, Killian's
been breathing down my neck, and I'm starting to take it personal. [Gizmo snorts] And
that's where you come in, slick.}
{37010}{}{What do you want me to do?}
{37020}{}{If you think I'd help you, you're fat and stupid.}
{38000}{}{What I think is you're going to take him out for me, you know? No witnesses, just in,
over, out.}
{38010}{}{Why don't you send one of your own goons in?}
{38020}{}{I wouldn't work for you if you offered me all the money in this crummy place.}
{38030}{}{Sure. I can use the money.}
{38040}{}{I don't think so. Thanks anyway.}
{38050}{}{How much you willing to pay?}
{39000}{}{I would, but there must be no connection between me and Killian's unfortunate demise.}
{39010}{}{Makes sense. Sure, I'll do it.}
{39020}{}{All right, I'll do it.}
{39030}{}{No way in Hell.}
{39040}{}{I don't think so. Thanks anyway.}
{39050}{}{How much you willing to pay?}
{39060}{}{What a coward. Afraid people won't like you? Too late.}
{40000}{}{[Gizmo wheezes.] I knew you'd see it my way. As proof, I want the dog tags Killian wears
around his neck. Ya' get them, ya' get your money. Now, just get. And don't cross me. I
still got the kneecaps from the last one who tried.}
{40010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmox]}
{41000}{}{Thousand caps. No more, no less.}
{41010}{}{Sounds good. I'll do it.}
{41020}{}{Not even close. I don't want any part of this deal.}
{41030}{}{I wouldn't trust you as far as two people could throw you. Forget it, slim.}
{41040}{}{You call that a reward? If I'm to whack the guy, I'm going to need more than that.}
{42000}{}{[Gizmo laughs and coughs] Maybe you're right. I think you're worth more. 1500.}
{42010}{}{Now we're talking.}
{42020}{}{Thank you, but I'd rather not.}
{42030}{}{No way in Hell.}
{42040}{}{That's about what, a dollar a pound for you? Forget it.}
{43000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Gizmo05_1']}
{43010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo10]}
{43020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> DownReactLevel]}
{44000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Gizmo04_1']}
{44010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo11]}
{44020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo04a]}
{45000}{}{Funny.}
{45010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Gizmo05]}

